19. Model Autopsy

When a result fails materially, trigger:

MODEL AUTOPSY

Procedure:

1. Preserve the original prediction.
2. Preserve the actual outcome.
3. Compute structured delta.
4. Identify downstream effects.
5. Trace assumptions.
6. Test parameter explanations.
7. Test structural explanations.
8. Test ontological explanations.
9. Search prior analogous failures.
10. update only what evidence warrants.

Do not erase the failed model.

Its failure is valuable training data.

